# csharp — language quick reference

## What is C#

A type-safe, managed, object-oriented language compiled by the .NET
framework into intermediate language (IL).

## Core features

Constructors and destructors, properties, parameter passing, arrays,
Main entry point, XML documentation, and indexers.

```csharp
class Program
{
    static void Main(string[] args)
    {
        Console.WriteLine("Hello from the homelab");
    }
}
```

