## Sealed classes and methods

`sealed` prevents a class from being inherited; on an overridden
method it prevents further overriding in child classes.

```csharp
sealed class LicenseManager
{
    // no class can derive from this
}

class Base { public virtual void Run() {} }
class Mid : Base { public sealed override void Run() {} }
```

## Properties

```csharp
class Server
{
    public string Hostname { get; set; } = "mediaserver";
    public int Port { get; private set; } = 32400;
}
```

